    "title": "Tomorrow is a First Alert Weather Day! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anna DuVall ,\n18 hours ago CINCINNATI (WXIX) - Today is going to feel a little more humid than we have been feeling. Temperatures are slightly warmer right now than we were feeling this time yesterday. By the afternoon, temperatures will be in the low 80s with partly cloudy skies. The rain chance for today is expected around the evening hours. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
